+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/statements/cancel — cancel the person's last statement: removes it
+# and unbinds the claims it bound (live again; a figure an earlier statement bound is not restored). Only a steward
+# may; anyone else, or a person with no statement, is a 400 and writes nothing. Responds 200 with the cancelled
+# statement.
